target/
**/target/
# The Dockerfile packages a pre-built binary from target/<TARGETARCH>/release/ (staged there from
# the rust-triple path cargo builds into - see .github/workflows/ci.yml's "Stage binary at its
# TARGETARCH path" step, or do the equivalent `cp` for a local build) - everything else
# under target/ is still excluded (build cache, other profiles/targets), just not this final
# release artifact.
!target/amd64/release/cni-config
!target/arm64/release/cni-config
